1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,650
Your contact form could be losing customers
before they ever contact you.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:09,000
Too many required fields, a weak submit button,
and no clue what happens next all add friction.

3
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:16,450
Start with the essentials: who they are,
how to reach them, and what service they need.
Then tell them when you will respond.

4
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:24,400
More traffic will not fix a broken contact process.
Find the leaks first.
